OL,3,AEx-council leader jailed for fraud and
OL,4,Atax evasion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former council leader accused of
OL,7,Finventing a fake heritage society to
OL,8,Fscam a local authority out of thousands
OL,9,Fof pounds has been jailed for 27
OL,10,Fmonths.
OL,12,FJason Zadrozny set up the Ashfield
OL,13,FHeritage Society before applying for
OL,14,Fcouncil funding, which he then
OL,15,Ftransferred into his personal account.
OL,17,FHe claimed the cash was "to support
OL,18,Fheritage projects", but pocketed the
OL,19,Fmoney for himself. He was convicted of
OL,20,Ffraud and tax evasion on 21 September
OL,21,Ffollowing a trial.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
