OL,3,AEx-council leader jailed for fraud and
OL,4,Atax evasion
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Northampton Crown Court on Friday,
OL,7,Fthe 46-year-old, of Stanton Hill,
OL,8,Fsobbed in the dock as Judge David
OL,9,FHerbert KC told him he had "failed the
OL,10,Felectorate and harmed public confidence
OL,11,Fin the district council by your
OL,12,Ffraudulent conduct".
